# Proof: F-V2-INTEGRATION
# Top: tt_um_mcranny_protocol_emulator_v2
# Assumptions: Initial sampled reset plus explicit black-box assumptions in the top.
# Properties: Ownership, open-drain outputs, command gating, and configuration stability.
# Method: temporal induction; bounded success alone is insufficient.
# Scope and abstractions: formal/README.md.

read_verilog -formal -D FORMAL_INTEGRATION src/host_spi.v src/v2_engine.v src/v2_capture.v src/v2_input_filter.v src/v2_project.v
# Black-box submodules; the top states its explicit compositional assumptions.
blackbox protocol_host_spi protocol_engine_v2 protocol_capture_v2 protocol_input_filter_v2
prep -top tt_um_mcranny_protocol_emulator_v2
flatten
opt
async2sync
dffunmap
sat -seq 4 -tempinduct -maxsteps 16 -set-assumes -prove-asserts -ignore_unknown_cells -verify
